{"4855640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "VoidArmada", "steam_appid": 4855640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4865520], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Armada is a sci-fi sandbox MMORPG set in a vast and ever-changing universe where exploration, industry, trade, and warfare are all part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the safety of civilized space lies a frontier filled with opportunity and danger. Venture into uncharted star systems, discover hidden anomalies, gather valuable resources, and carve your own path among the stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Vast Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across diverse regions of space, from secure core systems to dangerous frontier sectors. Discover rare resources, uncover mysterious locations, and encounter unexpected challenges as you push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/79feccd8608ddff19a1dbb50c0c9e0f4.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/79feccd8608ddff19a1dbb50c0c9e0f4.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/79feccd8608ddff19a1dbb50c0c9e0f4.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Upgrade, and Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and manufacture equipment to expand your capabilities. Construct and customize a wide range of starships, adapting your loadout for exploration, resource gathering, trading, or combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/810ab958bb8f2de1a0450884b37e677a.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/810ab958bb8f2de1a0450884b37e677a.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/810ab958bb8f2de1a0450884b37e677a.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Marketplace and Resource Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources fuel the growth of the galaxy. Participate in an open marketplace, trade valuable goods, and compete for access to strategic resources. Economic opportunities and territorial ambitions often bring rival factions into conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/67b2d748c6ec8439fd7974374127a00f.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/67b2d748c6ec8439fd7974374127a00f.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/67b2d748c6ec8439fd7974374127a00f.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Large-Scale Fleet Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly solo or join forces with other players to form fleets and alliances. Fight for control of strategic locations, defend valuable assets, and take part in large-scale space battles where coordination and tactics determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/595126303f1e4eee82f30cf24595489d.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/595126303f1e4eee82f30cf24595489d.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/595126303f1e4eee82f30cf24595489d.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an explorer seeking the unknown, an industrialist building the foundations of civilization, a trader pursuing fortune, or a commander leading fleets into battle. The universe offers countless possibilities, and every choice helps shape your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the Void, only the Armada endures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/b0817a544415bce1d7348bcd09ab547a.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/b0817a544415bce1d7348bcd09ab547a.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/b0817a544415bce1d7348bcd09ab547a.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues or have feedback, please contact us at:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:qianking1024@gmail.com\">qianking1024@gmail.com</a></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Void Armada is a sci-fi sandbox MMORPG set in a vast and ever-changing universe where exploration, industry, trade, and warfare are all part of the journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond the safety of civilized space lies a frontier filled with opportunity and danger. Venture into uncharted star systems, discover hidden anomalies, gather valuable resources, and carve your own path among the stars.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a Vast Universe</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across diverse regions of space, from secure core systems to dangerous frontier sectors. Discover rare resources, uncover mysterious locations, and encounter unexpected challenges as you push deeper into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/79feccd8608ddff19a1dbb50c0c9e0f4.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/79feccd8608ddff19a1dbb50c0c9e0f4.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/79feccd8608ddff19a1dbb50c0c9e0f4.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build, Upgrade, and Customize</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and manufacture equipment to expand your capabilities. Construct and customize a wide range of starships, adapting your loadout for exploration, resource gathering, trading, or combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/810ab958bb8f2de1a0450884b37e677a.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/810ab958bb8f2de1a0450884b37e677a.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/810ab958bb8f2de1a0450884b37e677a.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open Marketplace and Resource Competition</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resources fuel the growth of the galaxy. Participate in an open marketplace, trade valuable goods, and compete for access to strategic resources. Economic opportunities and territorial ambitions often bring rival factions into conflict.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/67b2d748c6ec8439fd7974374127a00f.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/67b2d748c6ec8439fd7974374127a00f.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/67b2d748c6ec8439fd7974374127a00f.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Large-Scale Fleet Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fly solo or join forces with other players to form fleets and alliances. Fight for control of strategic locations, defend valuable assets, and take part in large-scale space battles where coordination and tactics determine victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/595126303f1e4eee82f30cf24595489d.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/595126303f1e4eee82f30cf24595489d.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/595126303f1e4eee82f30cf24595489d.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge Your Own Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become an explorer seeking the unknown, an industrialist building the foundations of civilization, a trader pursuing fortune, or a commander leading fleets into battle. The universe offers countless possibilities, and every choice helps shape your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In the Void, only the Armada endures.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/b0817a544415bce1d7348bcd09ab547a.poster.avif?t=1785208756\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/b0817a544415bce1d7348bcd09ab547a.webm?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4855640/extras/b0817a544415bce1d7348bcd09ab547a.mp4?t=1785208756\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you encounter any issues or have feedback, please contact us at:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><a href=\"mailto:qianking1024@gmail.com\">qianking1024@gmail.com</a></p>", "short_description": "Void Armada is a sci-fi sandbox MMORPG where exploration, trade, and warfare shape a living galaxy. Explore unknown star systems, gather rare resources, build powerful starships, trade in an open marketplace, and fight in massive fleet battles for wealth and influence.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Turkish, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Portuguese - Portugal, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps